  "question": {
    "prompt": "A tank has a capacity of 60 m³. A pump fills it at a rate of v m³/h, and the time needed to fill it is t h. If the tank must be filled within 4 hours (\\(t\\le4\\)), what is the minimum filling rate v in m³/h?"
  },
  "schemaVersion": "3.0",
