      ],
      "explanation": "\\(vt=60\\), so \\(t=60/v\\). The condition \\(t\\le4\\) gives \\(60/v\\le4\\). Since \\(v>0\\), \\(v\\ge15\\), so the minimum rate is 15 m³/h.",
